WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
[Instrumental music. OpsRelay: Supplier Disruption Brain.]

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
Open an isolated demo workspace without a password.

00:10.000 --> 00:16.000
Record a supplier delay and its source note.

00:16.000 --> 00:22.000
Trace affected customer commitments, calculated shortages, and response owners.

00:22.000 --> 00:28.000
Inspect the original source record behind the result.

00:28.000 --> 00:34.000
Ask which commitments are at risk and why.

00:34.000 --> 00:40.000
Review and approve a proposed action. No customer message is sent.

00:40.000 --> 00:46.000
Record recovery and recalculate coverage.

00:46.000 --> 01:00.000
Inspect the retained activity and decision history. All company data is fictional.
